OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 9 Oct to Sun 18 OctFIt
OL,6,Fwill be a changeable period as weather
OL,7,Fsystems move in from the Atlantic,
OL,8,Fbringing spells of rain or showers to
OL,9,Fmost areas. There will be heavy at
OL,10,Ftimes, especially in the northwest,
OL,11,Fwith some strong winds. There will
OL,12,Fstill be some drier and brighter
OL,13,Finterludes between systems, especially
OL,14,Fin parts of the south and east.
OL,15,FTemperatures will likely be near to
OL,16,Fnormal at first, perhaps becoming
OL,17,Fwarmer later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
